# The source distribution carries the package, its README, licence and changelog. The tests and the evaluation
# need the repository's helpers and fixtures, so they stay in the repository (pre-release test 2026-11-19, F16:
# the sdist shipped 22 test files without conftest.py or the helpers, so they could not run).
include README.md LICENSE CHANGELOG.md
prune tests
prune evaluation
prune examples
global-exclude *.py[cod] __pycache__
